A complete, end-to-end QR code generation application that allows users to create customizable QR codes from text/links or uploaded images.

Key Features:
1. QR Code Types:
   - Link / Text input: Directly encode URLs or plain text into a QR code
   - Image upload: Upload an image, upload it to Supabase Storage, and encode the public image URL into a dynamic QR code that redirects to the image

2. Customization Options:
   - Color picker for QR foreground and background colors
   - Size slider (128px to 512px)
   - Margin/padding selector
   - Error correction level (Low, Medium, Quartile, High)
   - Real-time live preview of the QR code as settings change

3. Download & Export:
   - PNG download
   - SVG download
   - Copy to clipboard
   - Shareable link for uploaded image QR codes

4. History / Saved QR Codes:
   - Save generated QR codes to Supabase database
   - View list of previously generated QR codes with thumbnails, type tags, creation date, and download buttons
   - Delete saved QR codes

5. Design & UX:
   - Clean, modern, responsive UI with dark/light mode accents
   - Tabbed interface switching between "Link/Metin" and "Resim Yükle"
   - Loading states, error alerts, and copy-success toasts
   - Fully translated / titled in Turkish (QR Kod Stüdyosu)
